-3-1-2-2\">\n                    Agencies still hold these rooms for those dates. Release the allotments first.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <a aria-label=\"Dismiss\" class=\"ms-auto shrink-0 text-[#8a94a3] transition-colors hover:text-[#081c36]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" href=\"#\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-x text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3-1\">\n                </i>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <link data-kid=\"1-4\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@3.48.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n    </script>\n    <script>\n        (function () {\n      var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n      if (reduced || typeof gsap === 'undefined') return;\n      // ONE orchestrated load moment: rows reveal once, then stay stationary.\n      gsap.from('.js-row', { opacity: 0, y: 6, duration: 0.45, stagger: 0.03, ease: 'power1.out', clearProps: 'all' });\n      gsap.from('.js-scrim', { opacity: 0, duration: 0.3, ease: 'power1.out' });\n      gsap.from('.js-dialog', { scale: 0.96, opacity: 0, duration: 0.18, ease: 'power2.out', delay: 0.25 });\n      gsap.from('.js-toast', { x: 24, opacity: 0, duration: 0.3, ease: 'power2.out', delay: 0.5 });\n    })();\n    </script>\n</div>\n",
